  "source_note": "The mirrored files match the identified firmware commit. Version 1.0.1 strengthens shared ROOM/HALL/PLATE reverb, starts new projects with ROOM2 sends 12/72/24/8, gives both built-in demos PART2 R/D 112, adds ENV-switched mixer LEVEL/PAN, and removes the lower duplicate NEXT indicator. Existing stored project values, v7 migration and eight melodic/six drum voices are retained. Master output remains volume and limiter only; physical sensing and pressure remain excluded. This is not a Roland algorithm emulation."
